{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "743fb82e16126bb65a540b21dd848a3a4d0b835186a7f4f9efd813f5b3ec5e9d", "ja": "フォーラグジュアリー", "zh": "『4 Luxury』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9a3b2bcbda513fe4a9656dfcbd30ae43a236a56b4c473267ac850efd3e92e54e", "ja": "ドラマのクランクイン前日、ルームシェア\r\n最終日。麗花の家で打ち上げをする5人。\r\nこれまでの感謝をプロデューサーに伝える。\r\nその後、みんなでユニット名を考えた結果、\r\n『4 Luxury』に決定する。", "zh": "电视剧开镜前一天，也是共居的最后一天。\n五人在丽花家举办庆功宴，\n并向制作人表达至今以来的谢意。\n之后，众人一起构思团体名称，\n最终决定命名为『4 Luxury』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9fdba04d76e094c2563be5ed26556f4c30fa0702c3fe79aac3d25338da7ac6b3", "ja": "（明日はいよいよドラマのクランクインだ。\n今日で、みんなの共同生活も終わりを迎える……）", "zh": "（明天电视剧就要开镜了。\n大家的同居生活，也将在今天告终……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "780ede6b172ddb8e4342c8d23ccbb86db4e0dfe1efc7c3f4cb2592c3c88fa31d", "ja": "今日は打ち上げに参加してくれて、ありがと、\n{$P$}♪", "zh": "{$P$}，\n谢谢你今天来参加庆功宴♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "c9dc0eb7e7ccd69cd0126f20f9fb1ff7eda0ddab558b8aa294e9de956610499c", "ja": "長いようで短かった4人のルームシェア、\n最後はパーッと騒いじゃいましょう♪", "zh": "这段看似漫长却又觉得太短暂的四人共居生活，\n最后一刻就来尽情狂欢吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1003_052kao", "source_sha256": "26f49b3225b3719e2913c2b65e618b7b9b92039e7156a17b4204f54eb53301fa", "ja": "このみさんは日本酒、風花ちゃんはビール、\n麗花ちゃんは何でも好き……。", "zh": "木实喜欢日本酒，风花喜欢啤酒，\n丽花什么都喜欢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "71b3d541cf58750ddeb905609b346dd77d8c5c7b8868c5afc0e7b9487f8232b0", "ja": "ふふっ、お酒の好みからおつまみの好みまで、\n今となっては、お互いにバッチリですね♪", "zh": "呵呵，从爱喝的酒到偏好的下酒菜，\n我们现在已经对彼此了若指掌了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "0112dc03c97afdb92996b7cf0ea55a03634c9560ec8bde2d65671e24e9ac2872", "ja": "ええ、そうね♪\nそして歌織ちゃんは白ワインよね！", "zh": "嗯，就是说呀♪\n然后，歌织喜欢的是白酒对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "15d5a08fd7ae340d0de9fb90340249526c0d5ec2414794925e640f690bd685b1", "ja": "そういえば、私達が歌う主題歌の、\nお披露目ライブが決まったんですよね？", "zh": "对了，我们演唱的主题曲，\n已经确定要举办首次亮相演唱会了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f6614545fd69d45632e8e2782f50e5c1dcd6fc9100019fce9efe11ff32092faa", "ja": "ああ。これからは歌に演技に、劇場に撮影にと、\nますます忙しくなると思うけど……。", "zh": "没错，接下来要唱歌又要演戏，要跑剧场又要赶拍摄，\n应该会越来越忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d1110089004639763b7d1aaa7a804979e14b33ea96ffac2a6b2050a6b1d99a8a", "ja": "みんななら、きっとどれも素晴らしいものに\n仕上げてくれると、俺は信じてるぞ！", "zh": "但不管是哪一份工作，\n我相信你们一定都会展现出完美的成果！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "a6ee9e0e9e4878a72a7d0dbee9a3ff7c9993227cdad152d08cfa26f40a4a2726", "ja": "はーい、頑張りまーす♪　というわけで、\n私の作ったアレの煮物、どんどん食べてください！", "zh": "好～我们会加油的～♪\n所以，请尽管吃我用那个煮的炖菜吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1010_p", "source_sha256": "80612720bd49fc8e9ec62aa5d894b16426bf2ec2cc4acb3637b2d82d57010252", "ja": "どういうわけだ？　というか、アレってなんだ？\n……と、とりあえず、いただきます。", "zh": "哪来的所以？是说，「那个」是什么？\n……总、总之，我开动了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6f7f1333aae3f0b46b1de7cba31510973f423f0826c876fe836e840104f9a765", "ja": "……ぐっ！？　こ、これは……。ウマい！？\nウマい……のか？　なんて変わったウマさだ……。", "zh": "……唔！？这、这个……真好吃！\n咦……真好吃？怎么会诡异得这么美味……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9910b6faff0d3ca6c037731fc0dbfbc88e27315f878b0aa227a26d8cb252c5ed", "ja": "あ、よかった！　今日は当たりの麗花ちゃんだった\nみたいですね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "啊，太好了！看来今天是好运的丽花呢，\n{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "980e2452576dc2eb06431e9f7c009ba22acc56ce1549226eebbfb3a65a4372c4", "ja": "一緒に暮らしてわかったんですけど、麗花ちゃんの\n料理の成功率って、50％くらいみたいなんです。", "zh": "住在一起后我们才知道，\n丽花做菜的成功率好像是50%左右。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8a72f04e65443180e5623f59029fff1096aeb4b9b9c951cb841db08719f5a046", "ja": "五分五分の勝負なのか……。\nでも、意外と悪くない数字だな！", "zh": "五五波的机率吗……\n不过，这数字比想像中还高呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "95ddb1732279f54e61e1c2205910b2ecbc3341213c95295b57637ac7191c14ec", "ja": "色々と忘れられない麗花ちゃんのお料理とも、\n今日でお別れなのね。なんだか寂しいわ……。", "zh": "今天就要跟各方面都难以忘怀的丽花料理告别了呢，\n总觉得真寂寞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5f16924c58b6db555615704936ddec70ccfd4f361e4b5be53625e496299cc7d3", "ja": "麗花ちゃんがお部屋を貸してくれたおかげで、みんなの\n結束も強くなって、ドラマの雰囲気も掴めて……。", "zh": "多亏丽花借我们房间，大家才能团结起来，\n也顺利掌握住电视剧里的气氛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d1de63058dd20a61f4bf82e452d88dc9f2ee055bb40368992b65e2b9cb71e155", "ja": "本番の撮影にも自信が持ててきました。\nありがとう、麗花ちゃん♪", "zh": "我对正式拍摄也开始有自信了。\n谢谢你，丽花♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "87dc35b3114548e3dc5400be03100eab0b9c98d78b419701bdb80c86065d77ad", "ja": "えっへん！　遠慮せずに、また来てくださいね！\nいっぱい掃除できるようにして、待ってます！", "zh": "哼哼！不用客气，下次再来住喔！\n我会把房间弄得更需要打扫，等待你们下次光临！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "1e505d71ca167377076bf66c489d03e7f95aace7440bb73f07cd87b20a461b68", "ja": "麗花、次はもっと違うおもてなしが、\nいいんじゃないかな……。", "zh": "丽花，下次换个不一样的招待方式，\n应该会比较好吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "715f1f676cf600be166584b0bcfc15722d04af13745aaca1f3bff5a271a561ea", "ja": "あれ？　でも{$P$}さんこそ、\nもっとえっへんって胸を張っていいんですよ？", "zh": "是吗？不过{$P$}先生才是，\n你可以更得意一点，哼个两声也没关系喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1021_p", "source_sha256": "1bd8c9734a0b7735f71b211767c5c545d4ccf6cf2db8114563bb99a9344d9cf1", "ja": "うーん、俺もこの部屋を片付けたけど、\nそんな威張れるほどじゃ……。", "zh": "唔～我虽然也有帮忙打扫这个房间，\n但没有到能骄傲的地步吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1022_039kon", "source_sha256": "7bc5050c2507c7aa1b9b4d088a3e16a24d8223dac0ef91cdc4e8b560f633b5ec", "ja": "胸を張るっていうのは、そういうことじゃなくて。\nはい、歌織ちゃんからお願いね！", "zh": "她所谓的得意不是指这件事啦。\n来，换歌织说吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1023_052kao", "source_sha256": "e2f81509b2ab89ff53267130e96c3bb50989a48663b67117a10c736278686c0e", "ja": "こ、このみさんっ！？\nも、もう……。", "zh": "木、木实！？\n真、真是的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1024_p", "source_sha256": "67dae1e83cac28822c00d45da1f4215c5be912a259308881b519adf33d62e095", "ja": "歌織さん？", "zh": "歌织小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1025_052kao", "source_sha256": "0fb0c96d4f4844a282ee3db1d57ebf286025b5e6ac9760492099e1d9f2b5ada8", "ja": "あ、あの……。昨日の夜、みんなで話したんです。\n{$P$}さんに気持ちを伝えようって。", "zh": "就、就是……昨晚大家一起谈论到，\n想要向{$P$}先生表达我们的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1026_052kao", "source_sha256": "a39ac4c244b66c23d4e1afd85bac6fb4af28c76f7fed8fdbdf1e4094066658a7", "ja": "みんなでドラマに出演できると聞いたあの日から、\nこうして楽しく、クランクインを迎えられるのも……。", "zh": "自从那天听到大家能一起演出电视剧后，\n我们能这样快乐迎接开镜日的到来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1027_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0d4d1a307534c4905d888aa09299e08a2a71752e28a4da7d7d2f9d5006af5a89", "ja": "{$P$}さんが私達のために、\nたくさん頑張ってくれたからだって、わかってます。", "zh": "都要归功于{$P$}先生\n为我们付出了许多心力。这点，我们再清楚不过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "8c3640d2a63ff2d3ff6b50fcba528fb62c274d992065b788edc1b1a762e2932e", "ja": "オーディションに合わせて、ユニットの企画を練って、\nスタッフにも、熱心に掛け合ってくれて……。", "zh": "不只配合试镜内容研拟团体企划，\n还积极跟工作人员交涉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1029_048rei", "source_sha256": "c69a3cf3c5c79f3fe30959e0b7dc9cbc56426bef114ee39c45f1586b9bbf46a3", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、\nいつも私達を楽しい所に連れて行ってくれます♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生总是会带领我们，\n前往好玩的地方♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1030_052kao", "source_sha256": "567ebc769c972e518931b2afb1cb39eb39cc35cdc937634fc5efd68b472e5ab2", "ja": "本当に……いつも本当に、ありがとうございます。\nでも……", "zh": "真的……真的很感谢你，总是这么照顾我们。\n还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1031_052kao", "source_sha256": "4320d432636877a60a2f6cfe457ec0fa90025f0964b50a0703e91ec275edfcdb", "ja": "これからも、よろしくお願いしますね！", "zh": "今后也请你多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
