{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1035_p", "source_sha256": "ae7804e14b5046f12144ec03b0e0f09d5fd11da4b4a481c5c18e1402cee5e2e9", "ja": "みんな……。", "zh": "你们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1036_p", "source_sha256": "cf84cbb83bc0449ef8bc3dde7899adc19aa8e3e912b32f3f858aa9b760eb5498", "ja": "ありがとう。\nこちらこそ、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "谢谢，\n我才要请你们多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1037_039kon", "source_sha256": "c6f60c68402ffced5b6b1c94e325da6f51b6fdeea6059fba936d438e031d8b51", "ja": "ふふっ、よかった。これで言いたいことは言えたし、\nさ、パーッと行きましょうか！", "zh": "呵呵，太好了。这下子就把想说的话说完了，\n来，我们开始狂欢吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1038_048rei", "source_sha256": "3c5d9acd8545c82f70f9bf61be0a5e5a8baec2c15132417d9f855b8363840bae", "ja": "あ、ところで{$P$}さん？　私達の\nユニットって、まだ名前が決まってませんよね？", "zh": "啊，对了，{$P$}先生！\n我们的团体还没决定名字吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1039_p", "source_sha256": "3334ae3ef64a3f35c4233d613acd1e14b4684994fdd514ba9ef3559616efef7c", "ja": "あ、そのことなら……このみさん、よかったら\nみんなでユニット名を考えてみませんか？", "zh": "啊，关于这件事……木实，要是你们有意愿的话，\n要不要大家一起构思团体名称？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1040_039kon", "source_sha256": "9d594ea4e65fedff0d5b4b5b681e0e910af5b12a656b53e276419a8e60df2a5f", "ja": "あら、いいの？　それなら、とびっきりアダルティで\nセクシーでゴージャスなユニット名がいいわ♪", "zh": "哎呀，可以吗？\n那我想取一个超级成熟、性感又奢华的团体名称♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1041_052kao", "source_sha256": "8706c02427c9e0d6c6bd6b8d28cfc10ef3205f56ecee4d34763b6606e9463d1b", "ja": "そうですね。そういうイメージの方が、\nドラマの内容にも合っていると思いますし。", "zh": "也对呢，\n这种形象也比较符合电视剧的剧情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1042_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a6746e1f33fb3691dc4af1334ad546cc5fb7ac43ec231938eec78dd036013d7a", "ja": "アダルティでセクシーでゴージャス……。たとえばエス\nテで感じた、ラグジュアリーって言葉を入れたりとか？", "zh": "成熟、性感又奢华……\n例如用我们在美容沙龙感受到的Luxury来取名吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1043_048rei", "source_sha256": "26d98a3a98768fbcc7f741d1432acb8419d8f4e6eade4fa43dcf2352852417fc", "ja": "わあっ、何だかキラキラって感じですね♪", "zh": "哇啊，听起来有种闪闪发光的感觉呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1044_052kao", "source_sha256": "10a304039e17993ba429618411b5e26f7f067efbbcf795bed724a7d85309f194", "ja": "そうだ！　それじゃ、私達を見てくれるみなさんにも\nラグジュアリーな、あの雰囲気を届けるために……。", "zh": "对了！我提议，为了让关注我们的粉丝们，\n也能同样感受到那种Luxury的气氛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1045_052kao", "source_sha256": "01862ed597867e579e470a0d4d4acba249926c53eebd22b3a3c64ef0d540b79d", "ja": "『フォーラグジュアリー』なんていうのは、\nどうでしょうか？", "zh": "就取名为『4 Luxury』怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1046_041fuk", "source_sha256": "45fb537b4f47ede6e0059a0c11bfe89234b20c8fac4b862534b81cc3ba577185", "ja": "あ！　『フォー』は、私達4人の『フォー』って\nいうことにもなりますね♪", "zh": "啊！\n『4』还能当成意指我们四个人的『4』呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1047_039kon", "source_sha256": "389a621e41bc40b242226cc46bc324f84641783c22592310b696ee4b3f37e81b", "ja": "いいわね、それ！　それじゃあ、私達は……。\n『4 Luxury』ってことで決まりね♪", "zh": "这名字不错耶！\n那我们的团体……就决定为『4 Luxury』吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1048_p", "source_sha256": "0ac02daf53bcc535244adba8ef03f7732d21b3ead65123cf99bfddf08c0c0c93", "ja": "わかりました。みんながいいなら……\n今日からこの4人は、『4 Luxury』で！", "zh": "我知道了，既然你们都同意……\n那今天起，在场的这四人就是『4 Luxury』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1049_052kao", "source_sha256": "ef6d21f5e73da65f189fbcf16f4ee4b9ab7faca5c70652cef1a05664fba64905", "ja": "ふふっ、素敵なユニット名が決まって良かったです♪\nみんな、これからも一緒に頑張りましょうね！", "zh": "呵呵，取了这么棒的团体名称真是太好了♪\n大家，今后也一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1050_039kon", "source_sha256": "6ad8fd6f9afd96226e4d2b3cb54cc50a64319c2614bec7ba0ae1436fd25d1dd1", "ja": "ええ！　アダルティな花を咲かせなくっちゃね♪", "zh": "嗯！我们得绽放出成熟的花朵才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_06_1051_p", "source_sha256": "033e512d213e8eee28c6e98c161e760cddcf91f191e4ce2b086efea98de70941", "ja": "（ユニット名が決まり彼女達の結束はより強くなった。\nどんなドラマを見せてくれるのか……楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（决定好团体名称后，四人变得更加团结。\n她们将会呈现出什么样的电视剧……真叫人期待！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
